  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Increased transfers of weapons, equipment and intelligence generate more battlefield footage, contested claims and leaked material that partisan actors and foreign proxies repurpose into misleading or false narratives, accelerating misinformation spread.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">gulf_maritime_escalation</data>
  <data key="d40">western_alliance_fragili</data>
</edge>
