  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">An uptick in frequency and intensity of strikes against infrastructure increases damage and precautionary shutdowns at refineries, terminals and pipelines, directly lowering refinery throughput and refined-fuel output.</data>
