  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained rise in attack frequency/intensity raises investor risk premia and insurance costs for firms reliant on Gulf‑rooted supply chains, provoking near‑term de‑rating of valuations for AI infrastructure and supply‑chain‑exposed tech assets.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
