  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher physical volumetric flows of oil and gas through regional export routes increase global supply margins and reduce short-term scarcity/risk premia, putting downward pressure on benchmark crude prices.</data>
