  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A rising risk of nonlinear Gulf escalation compels the US executive to de‑conflict and prioritize Middle East crisis management, producing more permissive or restrained policy choices toward Russia to avoid a two‑front confrontation.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">gulf_maritime_escalation</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
