  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher availability of commercial satellite communications and data links improves vessel tracking, command-and-control and deconfliction for navies and merchant fleets, lowering the probability of incidents and route disruptions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::satellite_comms_avail" target="western_alliance_fragili::misinfo_propagation_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Improved availability of resilient satellite communications enables authoritative, real‑time reporting and official messaging to reach affected populations and platforms despite terrestrial outages, crowding out rumor chains and lowering the speed/reach of misinformation.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">western_alliance_fragili</data>
</edge>
