<edge source="global_energy_supply_sho::fuel_inventories" target="russia_ukraine_war::allied_cohesion_level" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Larger commercial and allied-accessible fuel stocks reduce competition over scarce supplies and lower allocation disputes, making coordinated allied planning and burden-sharing easier and therefore strengthening cohesion.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_energy_supply_sho::fuel_inventories" target="western_alliance_fragili::misinfo_propagation_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Declines in visible commercial fuel inventories (or reports of shortages) create uncertainty and localized scarcity that generate rumors and falsified claims about causes and culpability, which spread rapidly across social networks.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
  <data key="d40">western_alliance_fragili</data>
