  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Rapid increases in diesel prices raise operating costs for edge and backup power (and logistics for hardware moves), causing operators—particularly in regions reliant on diesel generators—to delay or slow commissioning of data centers and AI deployments.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_trade_riva</data>
