<edge source="us_china_tech_trade_riva::deployment_rate_ai" target="global_energy_supply_sho::fuel_inventories" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Faster deployment of AI in supply-chain planning, demand forecasting and inventory management enables just-in-time distribution and tighter stock policies, lowering commercial refined-fuel inventory buffers.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade_riva</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_tech_trade_riva::deployment_rate_ai" target="gulf_maritime_escalation::transport_disruption" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rapid deployment of AI‑enabled maritime surveillance, automated identification systems and weaponized autonomy raises the probability of sensor misclassification or automated defensive responses in congested Strait of Hormuz/Red Sea traffic, producing more incidents that disrupt shipping and aviation operations.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade_riva</data>
  <data key="d40">gulf_maritime_escalation</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_tech_trade_riva::deployment_rate_ai" target="russia_ukraine_war::energy_attack_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Faster deployment of AI-enabled ISR, target-recognition and autonomous strike systems increases the ability to find, prosecute and time attacks on fuel, refining and transport nodes, raising the rate of energy-targeted strikes.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade_riva</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_tech_trade_riva::deployment_rate_ai" target="russia_ukraine_war::kinetic_activity_intensi" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Accelerated fielding of AI-enhanced command-and-control, targeting and unmanned systems raises tempo and scale of coordinated strikes and patrols, increasing overall kinetic engagement frequency and intensity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade_riva</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_tech_trade_riva::deployment_rate_ai" target="western_alliance_fragili::misinfo_propagation_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Faster commissioning of production‑grade generative models and content‑automation systems directly increases the supply and scalability of tailored false or misleading content that actors can inject into social networks, raising the speed and reach of misinformation.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade_riva</data>
