<edge source="western_alliance_fragili::donor_ad_spend_flow" target="russia_ukraine_war::allied_cohesion_level" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained increase in major-donor ad spending that amplifies isolationist or pro-deal narratives in alliance capitals shifts domestic politics and produces pressure on governments to diverge from coalition policy, weakening coordination and unified responses.</data>
